    {
      "section": "band",
      "items": [
        {
          "role": "heading",
          "order": 0,
          "text": "Discover more events"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 1,
          "text": "Follow us on Facebook."
        },
        {
          "role": "cta",
          "order": 2,
          "text": "Today we celebrate World Teachers Day! \ud83c\udf4e \ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udfeb \ud83c\udfeb \u2b50\ufe0f We have an amazing team of teachers at the Fort and are grateful for all they do for our students and school. Let us know which teacher has had a positive impact on your or your child by posting a message below. You can also leave a gem for our amazing teachers on the world teachers day map via this link: https://world-teachers-day-map.nesa.nsw.edu.au/ #WorldTeachersDay2026",
          "href": "https://m.facebook.com/1661675895966806/posts/1770173321783729#no_universal_links"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 3,
          "text": "east"
        },
        {
          "role": "cta",
          "order": 4,
          "text": "We looking forward to welcome everyone back on Tuesday.",
          "href": "https://m.facebook.com/1661675895966806/posts/1746224677511927#no_universal_links"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 5,
          "text": "east"
        },
        {
          "role": "cta",
          "order": 6,
          "text": "The countdown is on for our Year 12 students. We hope your study is going well but that you are also taking time to look after yourselves. Eat well, get plenty of sleep, take breaks and reach out for support when you need it. See you all on Tuesday 13 October 2026 for the first English exam. Remember to be early not just on time. https://www.facebook.com/share/r/14qQd4NQLBt/",
          "href": "https://m.facebook.com/1661675895966806/posts/1746223814178680#no_universal_links"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 7,
          "text": "east"
        }
